es are (appeased) by the simple change of nomenclature.'\nYou say, 'appeased'\nVasyryx Teken`tlar says 'Certainly. But this has not prevented all strife. From what we have been able to gather from a few escaped slaves, the priesthood is unhappy with the level of worship, of Rallos Zek, I would assume. We assume this is their god. Of course when the priesthood claims that there is not enough faith, that generally just means that the priesthood feels ignored or wants more power for themselves. But who am I to judge such things'\nYou say, 'represent'\nVasyryx Teken`tlar says 'My task is to learn as much as I can of the goblins of Droga. My overseer is called Praetor Denik, who is responsible for most of the, um, outreach we are doing. To that end, I have several (tasks) that I need to find someone to accomplish for me. Apparently my knowledge is too valuable to be risked. I am to find adventurers to (assist) me.'\nYou say, 'tasks'\nVasyryx Teken`tlar says 'Simple things, really. Only brute strength required. Is this something you (can do) for us?'\nYou say, 'can do'\nVasyryx Teken`tlar says 'Ah, good. I knew not to expect too much mental effort from you.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Drogan Toes'.\n\n---\n\n3. Collect 8 Drogan Toes. 0/8 The Temple of Droga [Empires of Kunark]\n\n\n\nThe Drogan Toes are pre lootable.\n\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n106pp 5gp\nExperience (1AA at level 105)\n**Need more info on this quest.**\n- 106pp 5gp, Experience",
