      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Frontier Mountains [EoK]\n**Who:**\n- Urul Twigslam [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Lore\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:30:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Syldon Spy Log [item=127747]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Rala`zan the Mindshadow [npc=51707]\n- Rikk`ti Crikk`t [npc=51253]\n- a Syldon deserter [npc=51695]\n- a Syldon lavamancer [npc=54226]\n- a mega lavabomb [npc=59971]\n- a siege lavabomb [npc=59972]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Frontier Mountains [quest=8350]\n**Era:** | !Empires of Kunark\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n**Appropriate Races:**\nEntered: Fri Dec 2 01:17:51 2016\nModified: Sat Nov 16 08:35:11 2024 | | Pre req: You'll need to have completed the following tasks in order to request this task.\nConcerned Citizens [quest=8272], Contacting the Leadership [quest=8385], Disappearing Dragons [quest=8262], Sneaky Sarnak [quest=8392] and Rocks Boom for Twigslam [quest=8410].\nSpeak to Urul Twigslam [npc=51230] to request this task. He is located in the big giant fort mid zone on the west side.\nSay book to request the task.\n\n---\n\n1\\. Read the Syldon Spy Log [item=127747] that Urul Twigslam found 0/6 Frontier Mountains\nHe gives you the spy log, right click it 6 times until it updates the task.\n2\\. Tell Urul what you found in the log 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nHail Urul Twigslam [npc=51230] and go through his dialogue.\n3\\. Find the Syldon spy South of Konikor 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nThe spy is located directly south of the giant fort. It's name is a Syldon deserter [npc=51695]. The task will update at it.\n4\\. Confront the nearby Syldon Spy 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nHail the a Syldon deserter [npc=51695] and follow its dialogue. Be ready for back to back fights.\nBug - if you /say the bracketed text to the spy he does not respond but if you click on the bracketed text the task updates\n5\\. Kill Drogan Burrowers 0/4 Frontier Mountains\nKill all 4 of them, they should spawn right after you talk to the Syldon deserter.\n6\\. Kill Dominated Wormcallers 0/2 Frontier Mountains\nKill the worms.\n7\\. Kill Rala`zan the Mindshadow [npc=51707] 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nThe deserter turns into this named, kill it.\n8\\. Find the Syldon spies South of Nearpost in the East 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nThe nearpost is located in the east south east part of the zone. This part of the task will update at Rikki`ti Crikk`t [npc=51253], it is located south of the nearpost.\n9\\. Confront the Syldon spies above Nearpost 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nHail Rikki`ti Crikk`t [npc=51253] and go through its dialogue.\n10\\. Kill Siege Lavabombs 0/6 Frontier Mountains\n6 Lavabombs will spawn in total, 2 at a time. They CANNOT be snared, rooted or mezzed. Kill them before they reach the tower. Chanter can knock them back.\n11\\. Kill Syldon Lavamancers 0/2 Frontier Mountains\nKill Syldon lavamancers.\n12\\. Kill Mega Lavabomb 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nKill it very fast. They CANNOT be snared, rooted or mezzed. Chanter can knock them back. If you fail, Rikki`ti Crikk`t [npc=51253] should spawn about 20 seconds later and you can rehail to start over.\n13\\. Return to speaker Urul 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nHail Urul Twigslam [npc=51230] back at the big giant fort. Go through his dialogue.\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n283pp 5gp\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 283pp 5gp, Experience",
