      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Frontier Mountains [EoK]\n**Who:**\n- Ingisitorma Varro [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:01:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Ancient Sarnak Bones [item=127835]\n- Cleaned Korshan Sarnak Scale [item=127842]\n- Cleaned White Dragon Scale [item=127837]\n- Cloudy Brown Liquid [item=127836]\n- Dronan Ore [item=127599]\n- Enchanted Ancient Sarnak Bones [item=127843]\n- Enchanted Dronan Ore [item=127840]\n- Enchanted Giant Lymph Fluid [item=127839]\n- Enchanted Imperial Ore [item=127841]\n- Enchanted Meteorite Fragment [item=127838]\n- Giant Lymph Node [item=127550]\n- Imperial Ore [item=127774]\n- Intact White Dragon Scale [item=127310]\n- Korshan Portal Resonance [item=127844]\n- Korshan Sarnak Scale [item=127814]\n- Mana of the Sarnak [item=127952]\n- Mana of the Sarnak Compressor [item=127772]\n- Metallurgy of Souls [item=127628]\n- Meteorite Fragment [item=127302]\n- Vial of Viscous Mana [item=14352]\n**Related Zones:**\n- Chardok [EoK]\n- Frontier Mountains [EoK]\n- Gates of Kor-Sha [zone=1091]\n- Kor-Sha Laboratory [zone=1092]\n- Lceanium [zone=1086]\n- Scorched Woods [zone=1087]\n- Temple of Droga [EoK]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Essence of the Dragon I (Group) [quest=8376]\n**Era:** | !Empires of Kunark\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 13 02:34:04 2016\nModified: Thu Feb 27 21:37:34 2025 | | Pre Req:\n\\- Achievement: Partisan of Lceanium (Concerned Citizens, Contacting the Leadership, Disappearing Dragons, Sneaky Sarnak)\n\\- Achievement: Partisan of The Scorched Woods (Digging Yourself Deeper, The Last Grove, Where is Burning Woods?, On Nobody's Side)\n\\- Achievement: Partisan of Frontier Mountains (Pentalateral Negotiations, Informal Diplomacy, Rocks Boom for Twigslam, Sarnak Among Us)\n\\- Achievement: Partisan of The Temple of Droga (Corrupt Before the Fall, Purifying the Purifier, Corrupting the Corrupt, Pure Success, Rebellion of the Pure)\n\\- Achievement: Mercenary of Gates of Kor-Sha (Preparations for Forward Action I, Preparations for Forward Action II, Preparations for Forward Action III)\n\\- Probing the Fortress, Their Own Medicine, Destabilizing Chardok (from Partisan of Chardok)\n\\- Investigating the Mysterious Sarnak (from Partisan of Kor-Sha Laboratory)\nTalk to Ingisitorma Varro [npc=51218] in Frontier Mountains to get this task.\nSay task to get the task.\n\n---\n\n**Collect 2 of each drop, they are pre lootable. Later in the quest you'll need another of each for some combines.**\n02. Collect 1 Intact White Dragon Scale [item=127310] 0/1 Lceanium\n\n\n\nKill Yeti's to the east of the city in Lceanium. Loot a Intact White Dragon Scale.\n\n03. Collect 1 Meteorite Fragment [item=127302] 0/1 Scorched Woods\n\n\n\nMeteorite Fragment drops from the Burynai at the crater in Scorched Woods.\n\n04. Collect 1 Giant Lymph Node [item=127550] 0/1 Frontier Mountains\n\n\n\nGiants in Frontier Mountains at the fort mid zone drop the Giant Lymph Node.\n\n05. Collect 1 Dronan Ore [item=127599] 0/1 The Temple of Droga\n\n\n\nDronan Ore drops from Goblins in Temple of Droga.\n\n06. Collect 1 Imperial Ore [item=127774] 0/1 Chardok\n\n\n\nTravel to Chardok. Imperial Ore drops from multitude of mobs. Click on them item link above to get a listing of mobs we have on record dropping it.\n\n07. Collect 1 Korshan Sarnak Scale [item=127814] 0/1 Gates of Kor-Sha\n\n\n\nSarnak's in Gates of Kor-Sha drop the Korshan Sarnak Scale.\n\n08. Collect 1 Ancient Sarnak Bones [item=127835] 0/1 Kor-Sha Laboratory\n\n\n\nAncient Sarnak Bones drop from Goblins in Kor-Sha Laboratory.\n\n09. Create a Mana of the Sarnak 0/1 \\- ( Recipe)\n\n\n\n\nIn a forge, combine all 7 items. Trivial at 202, You MAY fail.\n\n\n\n\nIf successful, the item will disappear and you will see the following.\n\n\n\n\nYou have fashioned the items together to create something new: Cloudy Brown Liquid.\n\n\n\n\nThe mixture boils and bubbles, quickly expanding to crack the vial you put it in. It quickly pours out and falls grossly to the ground only to quickly evaporate into a pungent cloud.\n\n10. Tell Ingisitorma Varro [npc=51218] that your first attempt [failed] 0/1 Frontier Mountains\n\n\n\nHead back to Ingisitorma Varro in Frontier Mountains. Hail him and then say smiths.\n\n11. Collect 1 Metallurgy of Souls [item=127628] 0/1 Brell's Temple\n\n\n\nNow you'll need to travel out of expansion back to the Underfoot expansion to Brell's Temple. The Metallurgy of Souls (book) is a ground spawn on a table near Brell Serilis.\n\n12. Collect 1 Cleaned White Dragon Scale [item=127837] 0/1 \\- ( Recipe [item=127837])\n\n\n\n\nIn a mixing bowl, combine 1 Intact White Dragon Scale and 1 Vial of Viscous Mana [item=14352].\n\n13. Collect 1 Enchanted Meteorite Fragment [item=127838] 0/1 \\- ( Recipe)\n\n\n\n\nIn a forge, combine 1 Vial of Viscous Mana and 1 Meteorite Fragment.\n\n14. Collect 1 Enchanted Giant Lymph Fluid [item=127839] 0/1 \\- ( Recipe)\n\n\n\n\nIn a Brew Barrel, combine 1 Vial of Viscous Mana and 1 Giant Lymph Node.\n\n15. Collect 1 Enchanted Dronan Ore [item=127840] 0/1 \\- ( Recipe)\n\n\n\n\nIn a forge, combine 1 Vial of Viscous Mana and 1 Dronan Ore.\n\n16. Collect 1 Enchanted Imperial Ore [item=127841] 0/1 \\- ( Recipe)\n\n\n\n\nIn a forge, combine 1 Vial of Viscous Mana and 1 Imperial Ore.\n\n17. Collect 1 Cleaned Korshan Sarnak Scale [item=127842] 0/1 \\- ( Recipe)\n\n\n\n\nIn a mixing bowl, combine 1 Vial of Viscous Mana [item=14352] and 1 Korshan Sarnak Scale.\n\n18. Collect 1 Korshan Portal Resonance [item=127844] 0/1\n\n\n\nIn Gates of Kor-Sha, go to the farthest east portion of the zone and stand on the portal at /loc +1873, -1648, +255 with a Vial of Viscous Mana [item=14352] in your inventory. You should receive Korshan Portal Resonance.\n\n19. Collect 1 Enchanted Ancient Sarnak Bones [item=127843] 0/1 \\- ( Recipe)\n\n\n\n\nIn a oven, combine 1 Vial of Viscous Mana and 1 Ancient Sarnak Bones.\n\n20. Create 1 Mana of the Sarnak [item=127952] using tradeskills 0/1 \\- ( Recipe) Trivial < 115\n\n\n\n\nIn a forge, combine 1 Cleaned Korshan Sarnak Scale, 1 Cleaned White Dragon Scale, 1 Enchanted Ancient Sarnak Bone, 1 Enchanted Dronan Ore, 1 Enchanted Giant Lymph Node, 1 Enchanted Meteorite Fragment, 1 Enchanted Imperial Ore, 1 Korshan Portal Resonance.\n\n\n\n\nIt has been reported you can do an alternative combine to get this item. I need confirmation for the recipe to make Mana of the Sarnak Compressor [item=127772]. ( Recipe)\n\n21. Report your [success] to Ingisitorma Varro [npc=51218] 0/1 Frontier Mountains\n\n\n\nOn completion you get the achievement Essence of the Dragon I (Group) [quest=8376] that grants you the first rank of the special AA \"Essence of the Dragon\". You also get the mercenary AA \"Essence of the Dragon\" for your mercenary.\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 638pp, Experience, AA: Essence of the Dragon, Merc",
    },
