      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Frontier Mountains [EoK]\n**Who:**\n- Ingisitorma Varro [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Success Lockout Timer**: 00:01:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Chokidai Sample [item=127829]\n- Chokidai Sample [item=127824]\n- Elimination Device [item=127818]\n- Goblin Sample [item=127826]\n- Insect Sample [item=127823]\n- Insect Sample [item=127827]\n- Kor'Sha Quartz [item=127305]\n- Mysterious Sarnak Research Powder [item=127627]\n- Sarnak Sample [item=127825]\n- Sarnak Sample [item=127828]\n- Snake Sample [item=127822]\n- Tuned Elimination Device [item=127821]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Concerned Citizens [quest=8272]\n- Contacting the Leadership [quest=8385]\n- Corrupt Before the Fall [quest=8724]\n- Corrupting the Corrupt [quest=8725]\n- Destabilizing Chardok [quest=8457]\n- Digging Yourself Deeper [quest=8395]\n- Disappearing Dragons [quest=8262]\n- Informal Diplomacy [quest=8382]\n- On Nobody's Side [quest=8381]\n- Partisan of Kor-Sha Laboratory [quest=8357]\n- Pentalateral Negotiations [quest=8453]\n- Preparations for Forward Action I [quest=8498]\n- Preparations for Forward Action II [quest=8773]\n- Preparations for Forward Action III [quest=8774]\n- Probing the Fortress [quest=8389]\n- Pure Success [quest=8726]\n- Purifying the Purifier [quest=8723]\n- Rebellion of the Pure [quest=8727]\n- Rocks Boom for Twigslam [quest=8410]\n- Sarnak Among Us [quest=8409]\n- Sneaky Sarnak [quest=8392]\n- The Last Grove [quest=8363]\n- Their Own Medicine [quest=8455]\n- Where is Burning Woods? [quest=8403]\n**Era:** | !Empires of Kunark\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Tue Dec 20 16:55:18 2016\nModified: Wed Dec 4 23:50:30 2024 | | Pre Req: The following tasks must be completed before requesting this task.\nConcerned Citizens, Contacting the Leadership, Disappearing Dragons, Sneaky Sarnak, Digging Yourself Deeper, The Last Grove, Where is Burning Woods?, On Nobody's Side, Pentalateral Negotiations, Informal Diplomacy, Rocks Boom for Twigslam, Sarnak Among Us, Probing the Fortress, Their Own Medicine, Destabilizing Chardok, Corrupt Before the Fall, Purifying the Purifier, Corrupting the Corrupt, Pure Success, Rebellion of the Pure, Preparations for Forward Action I, Preparations for Forward Action II and Preparations for Forward Action III.\nFind Ingisitorma Varro [npc=51218] in Frontier Mountains located in the northeast corner of the zone at 3701, -3081, 165.\nRequest Phrase: task\n\n---\n\nCollect 1 Kor'Sha Quartz 0/1 Gates of Kor-Sha\nThese Quartz pieces are ground spawns in the pond near the Frontier Mountains zone line area.\nCreate 1 Tuned Elimination Device using tradeskills 0/1\nIngistorma gave you a Elimination Device, put the Kor'Sha Quartz in it and combine, making a Tuned Elimination Device.\nObtain a sample from a sarnak 0/1 Gates or Kor-Sha\nIn Gates of Kor-Sha, kill Sarnak until you get a Sarnak Sample. Stick it in the Tuned Elimination Device and combine. Resulting in a Mysterious Research Powder.\nObtain a sample from a chokadai 0/1 Gates of Kor-Sha\nIn Gates of Kor-Sha, kill Chokadai until you loot a Chokadai Sample. Stick it in the Tuned Elimination Device and combine. Resulting in a Mysterious Research Powder.\nObtain a sample from a snake 0/1 Gates of Kor-Sha\nIn Gates of Kor-Sha, kill Snakes until you loot a Snake Sample. Stick it in the Tuned Elimination Device and combine. Resulting in a Mysterious Research Powder.\nObtain a sample from an insect 0/1 Gates of Kor-Sha\nIn Gates of Kor-Sha, kill Insects until you loot a Insect Sample. Stick it in the Tuned Elimination and combine. Resulting in a Mysterious Research Powder.\nObtain a sample from a goblin 0/1 Kor-Sha Laboratory\nIn Kor-Sha Laboratory, kill Goblins until you loot a Goblin Sample. Stick it in the Tuned Elimination Device and combine. Resulting in a Mysterious Research Powder.\nObtain a sample from a sarnak 0/1 Kor-Sha Laboratory\nIn Kor-Sha Laboratory, kill Sarnak until you loot a Sarnak Sample. Stick it in the Tuned Elimination Device and combine. Resulting in a Mysterious Research Powder.\nObtain a sample from a chokadai 0/1 Kor-Sha Laboratory\nIn Kor-Sha Laboratory, kill chokadai until you loot a Chokadai Sample. Stick it in the Tuned Elimination Device and combine. Resulting in a Mysterious Research Powder.\nObtain a sample from an insect 0/1 Kor-Sha Laboratory\nIn Kor-Sha Laboratory, kill insects until you loot a Insect Sample. Stick it in the Tuned Elimination Device and combine. Resulting in a Mysterious Research Powder.\nDeliver 8 mysterious Sarnak Research Powder to Ingistorma Varro 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nIn Frontier Mountains, deliver all of these Mysterious Research Powders to Ingistorma Varro.\nObtain a sample from a Kar'Zok 0/1 Kor-Sha Laboratory\nIn Kor-Sha Laboratory, attack one of the Kar'Zok Sarnaks (green), they will banish you to Gates of Kor-Sha.\nDeliver 1 Tuned Elimination Device to Ingistorma Varro 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nIn Frontier Mountains, turn in the Tuned Elimination Device to Ingistorma Varro.\nTell Ingistorma Varry you were [banished] 0/1 Frontier Mountains\nHail him and say banished.\nReward(s):\n319pp\nExperience\n**Submitted by:** Gidono\n- 319pp, Experience",
