      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Frontier Mountains [EoK]\n**Who:**\n- Envoy Kresh`va [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 95\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Factions Raised:**\n- Guardians of Konikor +1\n**Factions Lowered:**\n**Quest Items:**\n- Enchanted Syldon Bark [item=127543]\n- Glowing Frontier Gem [item=127546]\n- Sticky Drogan Net [item=127608]\n- Syldon Cautery [item=127544]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Asza Do`Saraken [ _Exodus Sentinel_]\n- Earthcaller Quill [ _Rathe Heretic_]\n- Ottar [ _Flastpost Head_]\n- Roald [ _Farpost Head_]\n- Tenlu Coi [ _The Coppicer_]\n- Venomrider Di`aak [ _Talk Talker_]\n- a Drogan eradicator [npc=51278]\n- a Lake of Ill Omen refugee [npc=51301]\n- a Syldon ambusher [npc=52843]\n- a Syldon flamewarden [npc=51258]\n- a Syldon slaver [npc=51274]\n- a Syldon tracker [npc=52842]\n- a possessed gemsniffer [npc=53857]\n- an enchanted grove guardian [npc=51698]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Partisan of Frontier Mountains [quest=8350]\n**Era:** | !Empires of Kunark\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Group\n**Min. # of Players:** | 3\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Mon Feb 6 22:36:19 2017\nModified: Mon Nov 11 08:24:32 2024 | | Pre Req: The following tasks must be completed before requesting this task.\nConcerned Citizens, Contacting the Leadership, Disappearing Dragons, Sneaky Sarnak.\nFind Envoy Kresh`va [npc=51221] in Frontier Mountains located in the ???.\nRequest Phrase: help\nThis task does not lock at any point.\n\n---\n\n03. Speak with Tenlu Coi at the druid ring 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nHead over to and Hail Tenlu Coi.\n\n04. Collect Enchanted Syldon Bark from Syldon Grove Guardians 0/4 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nIn the same area are grove guardians, kill them and loot Enchanted Syldon Bark.\n\n05. Use Enchanted Syldon Bark to ward 4 Drogan Eradicators 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nRight Click the Enchanted Bark on Drogan Eradicators.\n\n06. Return to Tenlu Coi at the druid ring 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nReturn to and Hail Tenlu Coi.\n\n07. Speak with Ottar at the Flatpost giant tower to the Southeast 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nHead over to and Hail Ottar.\n\n08. Travel to the Farpost giant tower to the Southwest 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nThis will auto update at the spot.\n\n09. Kill Syldon Flamewardens assaulting Farpost 0/6 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nIn the same area are Syldon Flamewardens, kill them.\n\n10. Heal Injured Farpost Guards 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nThe Flamewardens can drop Syldon Cautery, you can Right Click these on the giants to update this.\n\n\n\n\nYour faction standing with Guardians of Konikor has been adjusted by 1.\n\n11. Speak with Roald outside Farpost 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nHead over to and Hail Roald.\n\n12. Speak with Earthcaller Quill to the South 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nHead over to and Hail Earthcaller Quill.\n\n13. Collect Glowing Frontier Gems 0/6 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nIn Frontier Mountains, deliver all of these Mysterious Research Powders to Ingistorma Varro.\n\n14. Click on Gems in the area, these will spawn mobs, kill them and Loot the gems\n\n\n\nGive Glowing Frontier Gems to Earthcaller Quill 0/6 (Frontier Mountains).\n\n15. Speak with Venomrider Di'aak to the East 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nHead over to and Hail Venomrider Di'aak.\n\n16. Use Sticky Drogan Net to capture Highweb Spitters 0/6 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nAround the mountain area of Venomrider and to the North are highweb spitters, DPS them to 50% and then Right Click the Net you were given on them\n\n17. Return to Venomrider Di'aak 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nReturn to and Hail Venomrider Di'aak\n\n18. Speak with Asza Do'Saraken to the Northeast 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nHead over to and Hail Asza Do'Saraken.\n\n19. Tell Asza Do'Saraken you're ready to escort a refugee 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nHail Asza Do'Saraken again when ready\n\n20. Escort your Lake of Ill Omen refugee to the Northern Combine Camp 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nThis stage involves escorting a Lake of Ill Omen refugee [npc=51301] to the NE corner of the zone at the Combine encampment where you will find , [npc=51221] a Lake of Ill Omen refugee (Wwein) [npc=51301] spawns. It is tethered to the hailer and will not wander off, though has pathing difficulties. At various stages of the hike a number of mobs will spawn and immediately attack the refugee. She will kneel down and stay put during the fights. All mobs that spawn will stay attacking the refugee unless pulled or taunted away - this includes proximity social agro such as heals. The refugee has a lot of hit points and does not need a great deal of guarding until the final fight:\n\n\n\n\n**-356 -4833 36:** 1x a Syldon tracker spawns nearby\n\n\n**A Lake of Ill Omen refugee freezes in fear and shouts, 'I knew they'd find us! This is the first of many.'**\n\n\n\n**-384, -4190, 62:** 1x a Syldon slaver [npc=51274] spawns nearby\n\n\n**A Lake of Ill Omen refugee freezes in fear and shouts, 'Slaver! Don't let him take me!'**\n\n\n\n**823, -3347, 37:** 1x a Syldon tracker and 3x a Syldon ambusher [npc=52843] spawns nearby\n\n\n**A Lake of Ill Omen refugee freezes in fear and shouts, 'Syldon sends reinforcements against us now. We're doomed!'**\n\n\n\n**1728, -3477, -23:** 1x a Syldon slaver [npc=51274] and 3x a Syldon ambusher [npc=52843] spawns nearby\n\n\n**A Lake of Ill Omen refugee freezes in fear and shouts, 'What did we do to deserve this?'**\n\n\n\n**2716, -3686, 133:** 1x a Syldon tracker, 1x a Syldon slaver [npc=51274], and 3x a Syldon ambusher [npc=52843] spawns nearby\n\n\n**A Lake of Ill Omen refugee freezes in fear and shouts, 'An entire army approaches! What have I done that makes them care so much about me?'**\n\n\n\nFinally, deliver the refugee to **3578, -3304, 199**\n\n**A Lake of Ill Omen refugee says, 'Glory to Wwein and the Combine! I live for their bravery!'**\n\n21. Report your mission findings to Envoy Kresh'va 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n\n\nHail Envoy Kresh`va.\n\n\n---\n\nReward(s):\n319pp\nExperience\n- 683 pp, Experience",
