upid! Snally not try to be leader of clan. That stupid!'\nSay _control_ to Cave Overlord Snally.\n2\\. Speak with the goblin overlord Gentza of Droga about leadership 0/1 (The Temple of Droga)\nYou say, 'leadership'\nWhip Overlord Gentza says, 'You want to be leader now? No? Then why you asking about it? It is simple. Dragons control sarnak. Sarnak control everything else. And [Dronan] controls Droga.'\nYou say, 'Dronan'\nWhip Overlord Gentza says, 'He rules here. Unless that changes, you shouldn't talk about anyone else ruling the clan.'\nSay _dronan_ to Whip Overlord Gentza.\n3\\. Speak with the goblin overlord Boilwart of Droga about leadership 0/1 (The Temple of Droga)\nYou say, 'leadership'\nDepredator Overlord Boilwart says, 'Little goblin, you not need to understand being in charge. You need know how to do what you told. Let smarter, [stronger] goblin do leading.'\nYou say, 'stronger'\nDepredator Overlord Boilwart says, 'Of course me stronger, and smarter, than any chief. But me smart enough to not try to be chief unless priests want me to. Now go away.'\nSay _stronger_ to Depredator Overlord Boilwart.\n4\\. Speak with the goblin overlord Werlgra of Droga about leadership 0/1 (The Temple of Droga)\nYou say, 'leadership'\nLegate Overlord Werlgra says, 'That is a complicated subject for a minion like you. You should just put your head down and work. Let [me] worry about leading the clan.'\n\n---\n\nAt this point, say _me_ to whichever Overlord is the last one you talk to. This will spawn 3 trash mobs that attack.\nYou say, 'me'\nLegate Overlord Werlgra says, 'Ha! Even if I want take leadership, I will never talk to you about it.'\n\n---\n\n5\\. Don't let the bruisers beat you up 0/3 (The Temple of Droga)\nKill them.\n6\\. Return the Delivery Device to Vasyryx Teken'tlar 0/1 (Frontier Mountains)\n\n---\n\nReward(s) :\nExperience, Platinum",
